{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的关键语义没有视觉加亮，观众需要从完整句子里自行提取重点；部分感受词也不如X具体、细腻。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边看的普通观众，Y的左右分区更容易形成稳定的阅读习惯：左边跟住人物经历，右边捕捉即时感受，不必不断切换阅读对象。Y的完整叙述保留了较清楚的因果关系和情绪转折，尤其在18至19秒的短段落里，更容易抓住故事。X的关键词加亮、音乐节点同步和细腻的感受描写确实更出色，船、水波等意象的呼应也更丰富，但部分段落的信息密度和感受提示过高，个别补写还会让人物动机产生偏移。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d5e6ead7-de24-4409-a87b-1f53ac00e37e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T164501865245Z", "elapsed_seconds": 156.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:47:38.494566+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "43a64534267920f760c4da7f0d8a099695a812cf4f068de24ae36a1ee2d1f904", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_